      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "COMPARE",
      "estimated_duration_s": 16,
      "narration_text": "The key comparison is simple. W3C answers whether referenced network endpoints respond and is excellent for a fast baseline. TestSprite answers whether a hydrated interface supports an end-to-end user flow, including clicks, state changes, visual rendering, and media. They complement each other.",
